# Data never goes to a remote by default — this is red-line safety, not tidiness.
# If your data is 100% public and you *want* it versioned, remove these lines deliberately.
data/
!data/README.md
!data/raw/.gitkeep

# Fetched fulltexts are retrievable from the fetch log; don't bloat the repo.
literature/*.pdf
literature/inbox/*
!literature/inbox/.gitkeep
# The researcher's contact email for Unpaywall — personal, stays local.
literature/.unpaywall-email

# The dashboard is a generated view; the logs it renders are the source of truth.
dashboard.html

__pycache__/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Deliberately TRACKED (that's the point — they are the coauthor communication):
# PROJECT.md · decisions/ · logs/ · literature/reading-list.csv · literature/fetch-log.md
